gned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{\\text{new}}-(({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}+2){y}_{\\text{new}} & =y+{e}^{{x}_{\\text{new}}} \\\\ (1-(({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}+2)){y}_{\\text{new}} & =y+{e}^{{x}_{\\text{new}}} \\\\ {y}_{\\text{new}} & =\\frac{y+{e}^{{x}_{\\text{new}}}}{1-(({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}+2)} \\\\ {y}_{\\text{new}} & =-\\frac{y+{e}^{{x}_{\\text{new}}}}{1+({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, in the first step, the new $x$ value is ${x}_{\\text{new}}=x+Δx=1+1=2.$ Hence, the new $y$ value is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{\\text{new}} & =-\\frac{y+{e}^{{x}_{\\text{new}}}}{1+({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}+{e}^{2}}{1+(2)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}+{e}^{2}}{5} \\\\  & ≈-1.58,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to $2$ decimal places.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $y(2)≈-1.58.$" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326047 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326048 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326049 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326050 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1041 "field-1" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1104 #edb/ref 17592186326050 13194139535003 true] [17592186326046 1110 #uuid "37a8f92c-c9d7-5da7-96c2-ebca0b24fccd" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326047 1034 "-0.64" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326047 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535003 true] [17592186326047 1111 #uuid "254ba5f6-99ea-56f3-a6c5-f29d2bd44bef" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326048 1034 "4.72" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326048 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535003 true] [17592186326048 1111 #uuid "a590094d-1cdd-5c06-b85d-887b70c5bde8" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326049 1034 "-1.05" 13194139535003 true] [17592186326049 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535003 true] [17592186326049 1111 #uuid "dc892c02-c529-5b7d-96e9-a28df2c1696d" 13194139535003 t